  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Productividad y Des. de Nuevos Prodts. Ganaderos</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Productivity Support and Development of New Livestock Products</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo del programa es el de contribuir a la competitividad ganadera nacional con nfasis en la innovacin del sector de pequeos y medianos productores-criadores y la articulacin y proyeccin comercial de la cadena. El programa se enmarca dentro de una estrategia global de desarrollo econmico-social del Pas, que apunta a la reactivacin econmica mediante aumentos de la competitividad de la ganadera.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program objective is to contribute national livestock competitiveness. The project emphasis will be focused on the innovation of the small and medium sector producers and nursery owners towards the chain&apos;s commercial involvement and future projection. The program is framed in a global strategy of a country&apos;s socio-economic development. This will lead to an economic reactivation through livestock competitiveness increase.</narrative>
  </description>
